      "summary": "Mutsamudu, Comoros, October 29, 2026 – MEXC, a pioneer in 0-fee digital asset trading, has released its September TradFi trading data. Tokenized U.S. stock spot trading volume rose 81% month over month, while trading volume for AI-related assets grew 88%. Semiconductor- and memory-related assets accounted for 77% of trading volume among the top 10 Stock and Index Futures, while Pre-IPO Futures trading volume increased 60%. AI Trading Expands Beyond Chips Into Optical Communications and Power, With Four Sectors Each Growing Over 90% In September, trading volume for AI-related assets within MEXC",
